entries.answer:
**.replit:**

```
run = "nix run"
entrypoint = "flake.nix"
modules = ["nix"]

[nix]
channel = "stable-24_05"

[agent]
expertMode = true
```

**replit.nix:**

```nix
{ pkgs }:
{
  deps = [ 
    pkgs.rustc
    pkgs.cargo
    pkgs.gcc
  ];
}
```

**flake.nix:**

```nix
{
  inputs = {
    nixpkgs.url = "nixpkgs";
    utils.url = "github:numtide/flake-utils";
  };

  outputs =
    {
      self,
      nixpkgs,
      utils,
    }:
    utils.lib.eachDefaultSystem (
      system:
      let
        pkgs = nixpkgs.legacyPackages.${system};
      in
      {
        packages.default = pkgs.callPackage ./default.nix { };
      }
    );
}
```

**default.nix:**

```nix
{ stdenv, rustc, cargo, gcc }:
stdenv.mkDerivation {
  pname = "hvm-project";
  version = "0.0.1";

  src = ./.;

  buildInputs = [ rustc cargo gcc ];

  buildPhase = ''
    cargo install hvm
  '';

  installPhase = ''
    mkdir -p $out/bin
    export PATH=$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH
    hvm run main.hvm > $out/bin/output
  '';
}
```

**main.hvm** (példa fájl):

```hvm
main = "Hello from HVM!"
```

***

Szeretnéd, hogy részletesebb példakódot írjak a main.hvm fájlhoz, vagy módosítsam a build folyamatot?
